#: apps/setup/templates/setup/invoicing.html:4
msgid ""
"What every invoice needs: your bank account, payment terms, VAT and "
"numbering. Fee plans, which say what each unit is charged, are set up "
"afterwards under Settings."
msgstr ""
"Det som varje faktura behöver: bankkonto, betalningsvillkor, moms och "
"numrering. Avgiftsplaner, som anger vad varje enhet debiteras, ställs in "
"efteråt under Inställningar."

#: apps/setup/templates/setup/language.html:4
msgid ""
"Metra is in Swedish, English and Finnish. The Finnish translation was made "
"automatically and has not been checked yet."
msgstr ""
"Metra finns på svenska, engelska och finska. Den finska översättningen är "
"gjord automatiskt och har inte granskats ännu."

#: apps/setup/templates/setup/logo.html:5
msgid ""
"The logo appears on the public page, members' pages, letters and invoices."
